  "description": "The Core for WEB10 (The Source / WEB0) - the root source-of-truth layer of the OASIS Omniverse. The SourceManager returns the foundational OASIS_DNA configuration (the Alpha) together with WEB9 live unified status across WEB4-WEB8 (the Omega), closing the loop where WEB10 = WEB0.",
  "iconFile": "OASIS.jpg",
  "id": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.Web10.Core",
  "isPrerelease": false,
